    "work_id": "oglt-pl/leander-hispalensis/pl72_45_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Dicit enim ad eam divinus ser­ mo : Multæ filiæ congregaverunt divitias, tu autem super- gressa es universas (Prov.",
